Semua unit, teruskan masuk ke lubang angin.

428
00:39:26.364 --> 00:39:28.658
Paolo, pegang tangan saya!

429
00:39:38.043 --> 00:39:39.252
Berhati-hati.

430
00:39:41.463 --> 00:39:42.756
Awak risaukan saya?

431
00:39:43.381 --> 00:39:44.758
Berhenti main-main.

432
00:39:51.556 --> 00:39:53.850
