- Saya nampak.

470
00:43:41.745 --> 00:43:43.913
Awak baring telentang...

471
00:43:44.956 --> 00:43:45.790
Apa yang...

472
00:44:11.274 --> 00:44:14.736
Gye-young, cepat keluar!
Awak kata awak nak ajak saya keluar dating!

473
00:44:17.113 --> 00:44:18.907
Pergi ke sana! Sekarang!

474
00:44:33.630 --> 00:44:36.007
Jangan berhenti! Teruskan!

475
00:44:51.398 --> 00:44:55.402
- Young-joo!
- Young-joo!

476
